    bool_typed_parameter_accepts_non_bool_and_jit_corrupts_it_2026-08-04, 0, "coerce_param still coerces anything: `_ => Some(Value::Bool(true))` at arg_binding.rs:73; only the JIT-corruption half was fixed"
    bool_typed_parameter_accepts_non_bool_and_jit_corrupts_it_2026-08-04, 1, "2026-11-09 lane-p2-2 native evidence: stage2_new4.exe native-build of take_bool(b: bool) called as take_bool(42) builds clean with NO diagnostic and prints got=0 (seed interpreter prints got=true) - native both accepts and miscompiles. Cause of acceptance: default TypecheckPassSeverity is Advisory (driver_typecheck_severity.spl:82), so the HM Mismatch never surfaces. Promoting bool-slot Mismatch to an always-error (like E-TYPE-FN-VALUE) also fires on if/IfChain/guard/and/or unify sites, so blast radius over the compiler corpus must be measured first. blocked-evidence: corpus measurement of bool-slot Mismatch count under Deny + location of the native i64->bool param truncation."

